        "l": 321.0,
        "t": 100.64689999999996,
        "r": 557.8700000000001,
        "b": 73.03900084033614
      },
      "content": "IMPORTANT: The clamp is easily damaged during removal and should not be reused. Use the screw-type hose clamp provided with the new valve."
